Subject: build: Baton's workspace packages and their build settings

The apps and client-runtime depend on @t3tools/baton-contracts and @t3tools/baton-shared;
onnxruntime-node (packages/baton-voice) is allowed to skip its install script.
The scripts package typecheck leaves out scripts/tessaya, whose run-by-node tools import
app sources outside that project.

